---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MailBar from '../../components/MailBar.astro';
import MailPageContents from '../../components/MailPageContents.astro';
import '../../styles/mail.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service for Blanc Mail" description="Pre-release terms for using Blanc Mail on macOS, the local trial, Polar subscriptions, and the planned Blanc Bundle." path="/mail/terms" header="legal" analytics={false} social="none">
  <MailBar />
  <main id="main-content" class="mail-page mail-doc">
    <header class="mail-page-head">
      <p class="mail-eyebrow">Blanc Mail · Pre-release terms</p><h1>Terms.</h1><p class="mail-muted">Prepared September 22, 2026 · Updated November 18, 2026 · Effective when subscriptions open.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="mail-doc-grid">
      <MailPageContents sections={[['the-app-and-trial', 'The app and trial'], ['subscriptions', 'Subscriptions'], ['your-mail-and-account', 'Your mail and account'], ['warranty-and-liability', 'Warranty and liability'], ['governing-law', 'Governing law'], ['contact', 'Contact']]} />
      <div class="mail-doc-body">
        <h2 id="the-app-and-trial">The app and trial</h2><p>Blanc Mail is made by Bananify for macOS. The first 14 days are a local trial with no card required. When the trial ends, mail remains readable, searchable, and exportable; composing and sending require a valid Mail or Blanc Bundle license.</p>
        <h2 id="subscriptions">Subscriptions</h2><p>Blanc Mail is planned at $4.99 per month or $49.99 per year. Blanc Mail + Address is planned at $69.99 per year and includes Mail on macOS and one Blanc Mail address. Blanc Bundle is planned at $7.99 per month or $79.99 per year and includes Mail on macOS, Nodding Off on iPhone and Browser Patron on Browser's supported platforms, each with its own license key, and one Blanc Mail address. Changing between Patron, Mail, and Blanc Bundle on the same billing period keeps the license key of each app your new plan still includes. Existing Browser Patron and founding benefits do not include Mail. A current Patron subscriber may upgrade to Blanc Bundle through Polar, which handles any price difference for the change under its terms.</p>
        <p>New subscriptions will be sold by <a href="https://polar.sh/legal/terms">Polar</a>, the merchant of record, which handles payment, tax, invoices, cancellations, and refunds. Subscriptions renew until canceled. Benefits continue through the paid period, subject to payment status.</p>
        <p id="address-reservations">Before addresses open, you can reserve one Blanc Mail address name per email address, free. A reservation holds the name until 30 days after addresses open. To claim it, buy Blanc Mail + Address or Blanc Bundle and use the same email as your backup email when you set up the address in Blanc Mail. An unclaimed name is then released to everyone. A reservation is not a purchase or a promise of price or availability of any plan, and we may cancel reservations made in bad faith, such as names that impersonate others or are reserved in bulk.</p>
        <h2 id="your-mail-and-account">Your mail and account</h2><p>Your Gmail account and mail remain yours. Use the app lawfully and within Google's terms. The <a href="/mail/privacy">Mail privacy policy</a> describes data handling.</p>
        <h2 id="warranty-and-liability">Warranty and liability</h2><p>The app is provided “as is” to the extent the law allows. Nothing here limits rights that cannot legally be limited. Any liability for a claim about a paid license is limited to what you paid for that license in the prior twelve months, to the extent the law permits.</p>
        <h2 id="governing-law">Governing law</h2><p>These terms are governed by the laws of New York, USA, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.</p>
        <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2><p><!--email_off--><a href="mailto:support@blanc.day">support@blanc.day</a><!--/email_off--></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
